{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "66a4f9a21175e09bd33c940b2a68beeaad3aff283f1f0883e5b50bdb37aca827", "ja": "とどいて、シフォンケーキ", "zh": "传达到吧，戚风蛋糕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5cf3844ea3fbe23d0efdc5068da3eaed5bcaad50b5ddf949f72166edaec1ccb4", "ja": "中谷家に招かれた伊織は、父親の為にケーキ\nを焼くという育の手伝いをする事に。忙しい\n父親とは全然会えないが、それでもいいと語\nる育に、感心する伊織。そして二人は、上手\nに焼けたケーキを手にする。", "zh": "受邀来到中谷家的伊织，决定帮育一起为父亲\n烤蛋糕。虽然完全见不到忙碌的父亲，但育说\n这样也没关系，伊织对此十分佩服。随后，两\n人拿着成功烤好的蛋糕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3f9ab6f1a263e38f8c1c084a1122f8cd74aab619d544bde11cdcb718fcefbde0", "ja": "（あの後、育と相談した結果、伊織と一緒に\n中谷家でお菓子作りをすることになった！）", "zh": "（那之后，和育商量了一下，决定和伊织一起去中谷家做点心了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1001_ikunohaha", "source_sha256": "f082798094d9148f1aff3e0207679686dfb218776302482fc6c21bf15aac2217", "ja": "伊織さん、{$P$}さん、\nいらっしゃい。育がいつもお世話になっております。", "zh": "伊织小姐，{$P$}先生，欢迎光临。\n育一直承蒙您的照顾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d1ec67b23a4d2a89604082f92014db25c0d6bb78c0810b1de8ef80e00cf4e3c7", "ja": "ご無沙汰しております。\n今日はよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "好久不见。\n今天也请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "9c397c44ac2b2d134db3f8440c664ca5a66f30d88dfb501bdde5f4e9d45bc9d5", "ja": "育のお母さまですね。初めまして、水瀬伊織です。\n本日は、お招きいただきありがとうございます。", "zh": "您是育的母亲吧。初次见面，我是水濑伊织。感谢您今天邀请我来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1004_ikunohaha", "source_sha256": "a308815c984992b71bd48491fb745114934e1b1a620ebd6844fd20b2926661c4", "ja": "こちらこそ！　伊織さん、本当に素敵なお嬢様ね。\nかしこまらず、楽しんでいってくださいね。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你！伊织小姐真是位非常出色的千金小姐呢。\n不用拘谨，好好享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "67b5a9f2a0b46a69b27a634762c4a467b4e57402d81f8ed3fd8a9ade1815bf59", "ja": "キッチンを貸していただいて助かります。\nご迷惑にならないようにしますので……。", "zh": "谢谢您借我用厨房，真是帮大忙了。\n我会尽量不给您添麻烦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1006_ikunohaha", "source_sha256": "170dcd9284d95a70d56656fa9a85813d445cfc5689359f8ca6615099bcc365b4", "ja": "迷惑なんて気になさらないでください。\nそれにお菓子作りって、結構大変なんですよ？", "zh": "请别在意给您添麻烦。而且做点心其实挺辛苦的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "8278ead25e98080ecebf7ce1b12b7b7472e6bccb16e19f12cc6926c07c2f0f01", "ja": "伊織さん。今日はわたしといっしょに、\nおかし作りをしてもらうんだけど、いい？", "zh": "伊织姐姐。今天要和我一起做点心，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "396f3ed6c786736fb56350fc7d32eeca6804d4b783554795ac76e96e7f368324", "ja": "ええ、聞いているわ。面白い趣向だけど、\n何のお菓子を作るのかしら？", "zh": "嗯，我听说了。虽然是个挺有意思的安排，不过要做什么点心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "fb09c55f89887e1b0bd2648e7dd6cc2bbd24b000a7d9db037379a0d57972eb1d", "ja": "作るのは、たまごをつかったケーキ。\nシフォンケーキにちょうせんだよ！", "zh": "要做的是鸡蛋蛋糕。\n要挑战一下戚风蛋糕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "f43bfb505e8eb816a62be506fee68556c4fff7a827c4da726c5abb87a351e962", "ja": "わたし、おとうさんに\nケーキをプレゼントしようと思ってるんだ♪", "zh": "我打算把蛋糕\n当成礼物送给爸爸呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "5bd2666e9dd7a15ad3a1f354d742ccc69696f46f06e1643d1bd355033e8a9fb6", "ja": "おとうさんに、ケーキを……。", "zh": "给爸爸，蛋糕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "56faccd2b2996fa49d9001e1652646e63d6e2d62a340eba52c51f5bd497c5196", "ja": "伊織も、作ったケーキは持って帰っていいぞ。\n誰かに贈ってもいいし……。", "zh": "伊织，你做的蛋糕也可以带回去。\n送给谁都行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7f887eabd254c3efe53f06d8d9920d388ce95a4bfbe2553cf9351153ca2d3985", "ja": "作りながら考えてみれば\nいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "边做边想想，不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "5196a91ee816a4ec14c4b0232396547099883a2447f7def96b226131ad0394a7", "ja": "生地、焼けたみたい！\nけど……。", "zh": "面团好像烤好了！\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "c8da25f56cca0f723a6e7939dd43c13d08f38e4333a604992c3fdced4f59195e", "ja": "ぜ、全然膨らんでないわね……？\nこの伊織ちゃんが混ぜてあげたっていうのに！", "zh": "这、这完全没发起来嘛……？\n明明是本伊织亲自帮忙搅拌的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "07053257abc6509f8fff5fa0f493db482dbbc3bce653fc33c37012b383e1fe65", "ja": "膨らまないのは、メレンゲの泡立てが足りないのが\n主な理由らしいな……。", "zh": "不膨胀的主要原因，似乎是蛋白霜打发得不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d04df09cfa7bc5418eddcb7c777ebde34df6cd3e3da8e14fe88dd2e4f1fd1755", "ja": "ここは俺が気合いを入れてメレンゲを泡立てる！\nうおお……！", "zh": "这里就由我鼓起干劲来打发蛋白霜！\n呜哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bf3d9257de337124c1cd943f01fe3b01eb6bd36b78d2a0119a334c13963cf408", "ja": "か、かき混ぜ過ぎて手首が痛い……！　でも、\nこれで角の立ったメレンゲが出来たぞ……！", "zh": "搅、搅拌过头了，手腕好疼……！不过，\n这样就打出了挺立的蛋白霜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "8fc6179ceea03be99fcc24eb697f4f2692a55e1b6b7fb44290fa97181a7bb1cd", "ja": "わあ、すごい！　ありがとう！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇，好厉害！谢谢你！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "4f7cc666a62be764831705dd2eaad927c2ebe2d42d6707fb6b92052c84129e7d", "ja": "アンタの尊い犠牲は、伊織ちゃん達がきっちり\n活かしてあげるわ。にひひっ♪", "zh": "你这宝贵的牺牲，就由伊织她们好好利用起来吧。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "468591a9489c01eb840cb4fa7798800327557bf5cbeb3c354a3a603da28d41b2", "ja": "あ、ああ、頼んだ……！\nしばらくカメラは回せそうにないけど……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊，拜托了……！\n暂时恐怕没法继续拍摄了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "894b5d20561d6a4e1a00145d3ab16ed7026ed20a937dc44d077f319d63c6d9f7", "ja": "えっと、何回かにわけてメレンゲを入れて……。", "zh": "那个，要分几次加入蛋白霜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "f987376412fdc78b67ee4eb32618c263b21137f071680b40b493f5c11ac6ca1d", "ja": "粉をさっくりと、混ぜ過ぎないように混ぜて……。", "zh": "把面粉轻轻拌进去，注意不要搅拌过度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "cb6241cd4e8d796993d399ef649005b3bde91d6c1ff39a70b9ad06c897adffc8", "ja": "ふう、あとは焼きあがるのを待つだけね。\n時間的にも、これがラストチャンスかしら……。", "zh": "呼，接下来只要等它烤好就行了。\n从时间上看，这应该是最后一次机会了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "b7fbb69aeca915a4a06b91196014f7c572c3d3e5da583f7dd86e417b06a250ae", "ja": "うん……。\n今度は、ちゃんとふくらんでくれるかな……。", "zh": "嗯……\n这次能好好蓬起来吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "8255e2c512fff1adb765c122a253bf171a20db1b6f174880d1e1263df5ca8c78", "ja": "……。ねえ、育。\n育のパパは、シフォンケーキが好きなの？", "zh": "……。那个，育。\n育的爸爸喜欢戚风蛋糕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "ecdadcaf86dd916dd0e76bd377ebf98f62d5aeac4ea34ba158b2c7e2a8db4f44", "ja": "んー、わかんない。\nおとうさんの好きな物、あんまり知らないかも。", "zh": "嗯——不知道耶。\n爸爸喜欢的东西，我好像不太清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "30c52223e3ae255c2351c6708d4ac1f47bb95c1f80974d4695539ee577b4880e", "ja": "おとうさんが帰ってくるころ、\nわたしはもうねちゃってるし……。", "zh": "爸爸回来的时候，我都已经睡着了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "69c63ce4aef7217dce73c33693a8f9a311646445fa3c2769cf6a51defa4b9b5d", "ja": "わたしが起きる前に、お仕事に行っちゃうし。\n出ちょうで、家にいないことも多いんだ。", "zh": "在我起床之前，他就已经去上班了。\n而且经常出差不在家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "5808bb4eb355d77f6d6b042fe50993da612366b6cc2492c5e279d3bed72c7bb3", "ja": "そうなの？", "zh": "原来是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "493497a6c4d46e20f8b7c73c12918805923c827b81cb775508cca14fc6b9a2ee", "ja": "それじゃあケーキを見て驚いた顔も、\n食べてるところも見られないかもしれないじゃない。", "zh": "那样的话，说不定就看不到你看到蛋糕时惊讶的表情，也看不到你吃蛋糕的样子了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "73a5976417e9f1a74ae8d8f6b4ab2d2cda819a095a126ba50368c8f789c41118", "ja": "う～ん……そうかも。", "zh": "嗯……也许吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "808a821d830164265bd17d955121382e90c8d4faa4303237faf61bb7404f096d", "ja": "育は、それでもケーキを作るの？\n……どうして？", "zh": "育，你即使这样也要做蛋糕吗？……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "3eb38c113efe904f7136a2f632dd1451dd4523470954209bd7113ffef6073c88", "ja": "えっと……おとうさんががんばってるのを、\nおかあさんから聞いて知ってるから？", "zh": "那个……因为我从妈妈那里听说，爸爸一直在努力，所以才知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "c0bc548978190ee76345290ff353be4b7903dec992737abd77d5a51056afab12", "ja": "あとは、わたしもがんばってるからねって。\nおとうさんに、伝えたいから……。", "zh": "还有，我也在努力，所以想把这句话告诉爸爸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "eb21b382253af442db9cc959658dd4e1adf9a707d40ebdb4aca1977e581e591e", "ja": "おかあさんが、いろいろ話してくれるけど。\nケーキがあったら、もっとわかるかなって。", "zh": "妈妈会跟我说很多事情，可是……要是有蛋糕的话，爸爸应该就能更明白了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1040_030iku", "source_sha256": "055964a7675a323c1625dec0022d8884aece2964a802488cc43176ef9a888978", "ja": "わたし、もうケーキも作れるんだよ！って、\nおとうさんに言いたいんだ。えへへ。", "zh": "我想告诉爸爸：“我已经会做蛋糕了哦！”嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "196a22aabf531628aa239c84d4b43b7c8325398e126aa1226c574eddf795f119", "ja": "そうか……。\n強いんだな、育は。", "zh": "这样啊……\n育很坚强呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1042_030iku", "source_sha256": "eb258966b69d35be9ec044bffac6f0daee8cbdd478bcf2b802a03240b6ae7a59", "ja": "強い？　そうかな？", "zh": "坚强？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1043_007ior", "source_sha256": "db5f0f812ae009a0828d703d7b354a417a343b026871bc3183380829fb8edafc", "ja": "{$P$}の言うとおりね。\n育はまっすぐで、強くて……うらやましいくらい。", "zh": "正如{$P$}所说呢。\n育率真又坚强……让人羡慕得不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1044_ovensound", "source_sha256": "f87db1041b68be7c03eba77b13160c9c672b22b5983e53e2ce9b3a23835d0fa0", "ja": "ピピピ、ピピピ……", "zh": "哔哔哔、哔哔哔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "e7607a3c3688e116e5e051a33e147dd61c0e2b8955ef3154f3d752ce3b44156e", "ja": "お、焼けたみたいだな。\n取り出してみよう！", "zh": "哦，好像烤好了。\n拿出来看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1046_030iku", "source_sha256": "d04c3795727819408aa523aec0d42a39568d34c3b203321ee45e6098fd734036", "ja": "わぁ……！！！", "zh": "哇……！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1047_007ior", "source_sha256": "d04c3795727819408aa523aec0d42a39568d34c3b203321ee45e6098fd734036", "ja": "わぁ……！！！", "zh": "哇……！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1048_030iku", "source_sha256": "0d75f19764951aefa6e57340ceb6403d9a87611675a1c00f20d4497251d492b1", "ja": "やったね、伊織さん！\nシフォンケーキ、じょうずにふくらんだよ！", "zh": "太棒了，伊织小姐！\n戚风蛋糕烤得好蓬松哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "bc41baf526f3fda6e19b638388ea45f3a9c2621d2366da6c88b4aa75ae68647e", "ja": "ふふん、当然の結果よね！\n私と育が、協力して作ったんですもの！", "zh": "哼哼，这当然是理所当然的结果啦！毕竟是我和育合作做出来的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1050_030iku", "source_sha256": "0ffe274bfc9eaef33cb5bcf3bce68afd29633a1e9c9443c65ba1bcba633ee2bb", "ja": "デコレーションはどうしようかな？\nクリームをそえるのがふつうだけど……。", "zh": "装饰要怎么办呢？\n一般都会加上奶油，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1051_007ior", "source_sha256": "f59cae54ef375b7a4ff82e6fbccc793db706bf79fd3c072b7aa2c05d5308435e", "ja": "……あの、育。\nこの小さいほう、私がやってもいい？", "zh": "……那个，育。\n这个小一点的，能让我来弄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1052_030iku", "source_sha256": "8b1c1a89c0f3ff3c3acd9be568b116185588b0a7f9169baab4a6cc43b4212952", "ja": "もちろん！\n伊織さんが作ったんだから、持って帰らなくちゃ♪", "zh": "当然可以！\n既然是伊织姐姐做的，那一定要带回去才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "6125bb5f8103664ad4841d58426c082624c3e39a7e94d190cde198f1c961fa44", "ja": "（デコレーションをする様子を動画に収めて……\n時間はかかったけど、ケーキ作りは大成功だ！）", "zh": "（把装饰蛋糕的过程拍成了视频……虽然花了不少时间，但蛋糕做得非常成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_05_1054_p", "source_sha256": "daeae0e0a0288c2f8de9edd9c3bbd3b403a4a30b8a5354be4493e1ec79dc2bb1", "ja": "（……ふたりのシフォンケーキ、それぞれの\n思う相手にちゃんと届くといいな……）", "zh": "（……希望两个人做的戚风蛋糕，都能好好送到各自心里想着的那个人手中……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
